00:00:58,203 --> 00:01:00,606
But let's start with the server. In there, I

24
00:01:00,606 --> 00:01:02,721
got a server.ts file, which is exactly the

25
00:01:02,769 --> 00:01:05,573
file this dev script starts. And in that

