00:01:07,240 --> 00:01:10,316
I have my Bun server set up with bun serve.

28
00:01:10,364 --> 00:01:12,784
So using the default Bun serve API,

29
00:01:13,345 --> 00:01:15,732
configuring my port, a route to which I'll

