00:02:33,947 --> 00:02:36,982
But most importantly, it offers this upgrade

63
00:02:37,030 --> 00:02:37,785
method to

64
00:02:38,363 --> 00:02:40,515
upgrade this connection, which was

65
00:02:40,563 --> 00:02:43,068
