66
00:02:43,678 --> 00:02:45,814
Therefore, it requires the request, which

67
00:02:46,488 --> 00:02:49,122
identifies or establishes this connection

68
00:02:49,122 --> 00:02:51,770
that should be upgraded. And then some extra

