00:04:22,250 --> 00:04:23,070
cleanup work here.

108
00:04:23,595 --> 00:04:25,613
But again, we'll dive into all of that in

109
00:04:25,646 --> 00:04:26,007
detail.

110
00:04:27,730 --> 00:04:30,643
So the data that we're passing into this

