00:05:43,549 --> 00:05:46,409
exactly the shape I'm passing into my data

140
00:05:46,409 --> 00:05:48,482
here. So that's where all these things come

141
00:05:48,595 --> 00:05:48,868
together.

142
00:05:49,478 --> 00:05:51,310
Now in these methods, you then have a

143
00:05:51,326 --> 00:05:54,218
WebSocket object. It's passed in as a first

144
00:05:54,283 --> 00:05:55,841
argument to all these methods,

145
00:05:56,452 --> 00:05:58,155
all these methods that are supported by

146
00:05:58,155 --> 00:05:59,521
Bun's WebSocket server,

147
00:06:00,308 --> 00:06:02,059
and that ws object

148
00:06:02,636 --> 00:06:05,745
object which you get has various properties

149
00:06:06,001 --> 00:06:06,546
and methods.

