173
00:07:06,279 --> 00:07:09,662
We also have a publish method, not on the WS

174
00:07:09,790 --> 00:07:12,291
object though, but instead on the server. So

175
00:07:12,291 --> 00:07:14,327
the same server we called upgrade on

176
00:07:15,097 --> 00:07:19,602
to publish a new message to a topic. So we

